        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>金句合集</title>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async\n  src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\">\n</script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background-color: #ffffff;\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n    color: #333;\n    max-width: 550px;\n  }\n\n  .header {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    padding: 18px 16px 10px 16px;\n  }\n\n  .header-left {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    color: #333;\n    font-weight: 500;\n  }\n\n  .header-left .arrow {\n    font-size: 18px;\n    margin-right: 6px;\n    color: #555;\n  }\n\n  .header-icons {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 22px;\n  }\n\n  .icon-circle {\n    width: 24px;\n    height: 24px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    border: 1.5px solid #f0a500;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    color: #f0a500;\n    font-size: 13px;\n  }\n\n  .section {\n    padding: 6px 20px 24px 20px;\n  }\n\n  .section-title {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    margin-bottom: 18px;\n  }\n\n  .check-icon {\n    width: 20px;\n    height: 20px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background-color: #f0a500;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    margin-right: 10px;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n\n  .section-title span {\n    font-size: 17px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: #222;\n  }\n\n  .quote-block {\n    font-size: 15.5px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    color: #444;\n    text-align: justify;\n    padding-left: 30px;\n  }\n\n  .source {\n    color: #888;\n  }\n\n  .spacer {\n    height: 28px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <div class=\"header-left\">\n      <span class=\"arrow\">&#8249;</span>\n      <span>金句合集</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"header-icons\">\n      <div class=\"icon-circle\">&#128100;</div>\n      <div class=\"icon-circle\">&#8593;</div>\n      <div class=\"icon-circle\">&#8230;</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"section-title\">\n      <div class=\"check-icon\">&#10003;</div>\n      <span>他写「成长」，正是你所亲历</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"quote-block\">\n      \"我经由光阴，经由山水，经由乡村和城市，同样我也经由别人，经由一切他者以及由之引生的思绪和梦想而走成了我。那路途中的一切，有些与我擦肩而过从此天各一方，有些便永久驻进我的心魂，雕琢我，塑造我，锤炼我，融入我而成为我。\"<br>\n      <span class=\"source\">——《病隙碎笔》</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"spacer\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"section-title\">\n      <div class=\"check-icon\">&#10003;</div>\n      <span>他写「磨难」，报之以歌</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"quote-block\">\n      \"大劫大难之后人不该失去锐气，不该失去热度，你镇定了但仍在燃烧，你平稳了却更加浩荡。\"<span class=\"source\">——《好运设计》</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
